{"articleNo":"559759","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=559759&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[학적] (2026-1학기 접수) 2026학년도 2학기 전공배정 신청기간 안내(건축토목환경/전자/컴퓨터공학부)","writer":"교무과","writeDate":"2026.04.21","hit":"4215","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; background-color: rgb(255, 0, 127); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b>(2026학년도 1학기 접수)</b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.2pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학년도</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;2</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">학기 전공배정 신청기간을</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;다음과 같이 안내드리니,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -14.8pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: -0.2pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">기간 내 신청하시기</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.8pt; font-size: 18pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; background-color: rgb(124, 67, 177); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">.</span></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">1. 신청 대상: 건축토목환경공학부, 전자공학부, 컴퓨터공학부</span></span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;소속 재학생</span></font></b></div><div style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">&nbsp; ※ 2024학년도 이전 학과 및 건축학부로 입학한 학생의 경우, 전공배정 경과조치에 따라 교무과에서 전공 입력(직접 신청 불필요)</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><b>2. 신청 기간</b></span></span><b style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">: 2026.05.04.(월) 09:00:01 ~ 05.08.(금) 23:59:59</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span>학부별 신청 기간 이외에는 시스템 접속 및 전공배정 신청 불가</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※ 신청은 마감일 23:59:59까지 가능. 단, 교무과 및 학과 문의는 근무시간 내에만 가능</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 14pt;\">3. 신청 방법: 통합정보시스템-학적-전공배정신청</span></b></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">※&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\">본인 희망 전공 순으로 학부 내 전공을 모두 신청</span>하여야 하며,&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 127);\"><b>희망 전공 선택 후 반드시 저장, 신청을 클릭하여야 전공배정 신청이 완료됨</b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Verdana, sans-serif\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (학부내 전공이 3개일 경우 3개의 전공을 본인 희망 전공 순으로 모두 신청)</font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin: 0px 5pt 0px 0px; padding: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; word-break: break-all;\"><b style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span sty